<title>USA: Delta Financial names Richard Blass CFO.</title>
<headline>Delta Financial names Richard Blass CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WOODBRURY, N.Y. 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delta Financial Corp said Wednesday it had named Richard Blass to the post of chief financial officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Blass is the company's senior vice president of finance and securitization and is also a director.</p>
<p>Delta is a finance company engaged in originating, acquiring, selling and servicing non-conforming home equity loans.</p>
